{
  "id": "1CH.14",
  "number": "14",
  "bookId": "1CH",
  "reference": "1 Chronicles 14",
  "verseCount": 17,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "14",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "King Hiram of Tyre sent a trade mission to David; he provided him with cedar logs and with stonemasons and carpenters to build a palace. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And so David realized that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had established him as king of Israel and was making his kingdom prosperous for the sake of his people.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There in Jerusalem, David married more wives and had more sons and daughters. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The following children were born to him in Jerusalem: Shammua, Shobab, Nathan, Solomon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibhar, Elishua, Elpelet, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nogah, Nepheg, Japhia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elishama, Beeliada,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14.7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Beeliada",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": Called Eliada in 3.8.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and Eliphelet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the Philistines heard that David had now been made king over the whole country of Israel, their army went out to capture him. So David marched out to meet them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Philistines arrived at the Valley of Rephaim and began plundering. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David asked God, “Shall I attack the Philistines? Will you give me the victory?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " answered, “Yes, attack! I will give you the victory!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So David attacked them at Baal Perazim and defeated them. He said, “God has used me to break through the enemy army like a flood.” So that place is called Baal Perazim.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14.11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Baal Perazim",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": This name in Hebrew means “Lord of the Breakthrough”.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the Philistines fled, they left their idols behind, and David gave orders for them to be burnt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Soon the Philistines returned to the valley and started plundering it again. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Once more David consulted God, who answered, “Don't attack them from here, but go round and get ready to attack them from the other side, near the balsam trees. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When you hear the sound of marching in the treetops, then attack, because I will be marching ahead of you to defeat the Philistine army.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David did what God had commanded, and so he drove the Philistines back from Gibeon all the way to Gezer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David's fame spread everywhere, and the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " made every nation afraid of him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
